=rcheckbook=

'''Author:''' Bryce Campbell

'''License:''' See LICENSE

'''Description:''' A Rust-based CLI ledger that can help you keep track 
of finances.

'''Version:''' 0.7.0

==Notes==

This program has been tested on macOS Tahoe, but <strong>should</strong> work on any platform.

